{"id":"83639a9615c06195","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-cfg-language-class.md","title":"Context-Free Language","display":"df-context-free-language — Context-Free Language","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-cfg-language-class","aliases":["73-df-cfg-language-class","73-df-context-free-language"],"display":"df-context-free-language — Context-Free Language","depends_on":["[[73-df-cfg-generated-language]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-cfg-language-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-cfg-language-class</span><span>73-df-context-free-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-context-free-language — Context-Free Language"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"97562bc4aa1d6014\" href=\"?note=97562bc4aa1d6014\" title=\"73-df-cfg-generated-language\">73-df-cfg-generated-language</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> (alphabet)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> (context-free grammar class)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(G)\">\\(L(G)\\)</span> (language generated by a grammar, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"97562bc4aa1d6014\" href=\"?note=97562bc4aa1d6014\" title=\"73-df-cfg-generated-language\">73-df-cfg-generated-language</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\">\\(L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ContextFree}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\operatorname{ContextFree}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> 是此语言域上的谓词。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\n\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists G\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\;(L=L(G))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\n\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists G\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\;(L=L(G))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ContextFree}_{\\Sigma}(L)\\leftrightarrow L\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ContextFree}_{\\Sigma}(L)\\leftrightarrow L\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条目的对象和定义式不变；本节仅补齐统一的条目结构，解释所需的全部参数仍在 Hypothesis 中。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-cfg-generated-language","status":"resolved","id":"97562bc4aa1d6014","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-generated-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-generated-language","status":"resolved","id":"97562bc4aa1d6014","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L(G)$ (language generated by a grammar, see [[73-df-cfg-